    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/e4585e268e62c62d42f47872326ef554.poster.avif?t=1716191879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/e4585e268e62c62d42f47872326ef554.webm?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/e4585e268e62c62d42f47872326ef554.mp4?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dive into a thrilling car crushing sim with diverse levels. Each arena offers new stacks of cars to demolish. Customize ramp height and speed for epic crashes, destroy stacks, and earn coins to upgrade your arena.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/76069bf11fe0d1df61cc96846264868b.poster.avif?t=1716191879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/76069bf11fe0d1df61cc96846264868b.webm?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/76069bf11fe0d1df61cc96846264868b.mp4?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unlock and choose from an extensive selection of vehicles, each with its own physics, and experience the excitement of crashing in style with your favorite ride!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/aa528a09809337fb771302f722a7c3ae.poster.avif?t=1716191879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/aa528a09809337fb771302f722a7c3ae.webm?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/aa528a09809337fb771302f722a7c3ae.mp4?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Crash your way to victory, rack up points, and revel in the exhilarating fun of destruction. Unleash your inner daredevil and enjoy the addictive chaos!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/8d851c82e40a192369dbce26321ea461.poster.avif?t=1716191879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/8d851c82e40a192369dbce26321ea461.webm?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/8d851c82e40a192369dbce26321ea461.mp4?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Choose from an extensive collection of awesome vehicles and go on a smashy rampage!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/05a7b13080ffdedd3be413f639b2988e.poster.avif?t=1716191879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/05a7b13080ffdedd3be413f639b2988e.webm?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/05a7b13080ffdedd3be413f639b2988e.mp4?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/e4585e268e62c62d42f47872326ef554.poster.avif?t=1716191879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/e4585e268e62c62d42f47872326ef554.webm?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/e4585e268e62c62d42f47872326ef554.mp4?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dive into a thrilling car crushing sim with diverse levels. Each arena offers new stacks of cars to demolish. Customize ramp height and speed for epic crashes, destroy stacks, and earn coins to upgrade your arena.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/76069bf11fe0d1df61cc96846264868b.poster.avif?t=1716191879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/76069bf11fe0d1df61cc96846264868b.webm?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/76069bf11fe0d1df61cc96846264868b.mp4?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unlock and choose from an extensive selection of vehicles, each with its own physics, and experience the excitement of crashing in style with your favorite ride!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/aa528a09809337fb771302f722a7c3ae.poster.avif?t=1716191879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/aa528a09809337fb771302f722a7c3ae.webm?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/aa528a09809337fb771302f722a7c3ae.mp4?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Crash your way to victory, rack up points, and revel in the exhilarating fun of destruction. Unleash your inner daredevil and enjoy the addictive chaos!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/8d851c82e40a192369dbce26321ea461.poster.avif?t=1716191879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/8d851c82e40a192369dbce26321ea461.webm?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/8d851c82e40a192369dbce26321ea461.mp4?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Choose from an extensive collection of awesome vehicles and go on a smashy rampage!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/05a7b13080ffdedd3be413f639b2988e.poster.avif?t=1716191879\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/05a7b13080ffdedd3be413f639b2988e.webm?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2367660/extras/05a7b13080ffdedd3be413f639b2988e.mp4?t=1716191879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
